    "## <span class=\"title2\"> Chained Comparisons </span>\n",
    "Readable conditions with multiple comparisons.\n",
    "### <span class=\"title3\">Syntax how to use:</span>\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    x = 5\n",
    "    print(1 < x < 10)  # True\n",
    "    print(10 > x > 1)  # True\n",
    "```"
